## Optional Madi continuity

- Use the `madi` stdio tools only when this project has been explicitly configured.
- At startup or resume, request bounded context for the selected workstream.
- Before compaction, at a milestone, or on a manual checkpoint, select and sanitize the continuity facts yourself. Do not include raw conversation text or tool output.
- Put the selected JSON checkpoint in this project's `.madi/checkpoints/` directory (or configured temporary storage) and use the Claude adapter to submit it.
- A lifecycle event by itself never saves a revision. If Madi is unavailable, continue ordinary work and retry a manual checkpoint later.

